e: A Project entity should usually have ownerId so each user only sees their own projects.\nCommon mistake: Creating records without ownership fields.\nBest practice: Add ownerId to user-owned entities and filter records by the logged-in user.\n\nRules:\n- Do not overwhelm beginners.\n- Avoid jargon when possible.\n- Define technical terms.\n- Keep examples Base44-specific.",
